                                                "sense_id": "400306fc-edb3-39c3-89b5-d41a259e2b82",
                                                "text": "Life plus accidental death and dismemberment; disability income; in-hospital indemnity; major medical; ADD/250 high-limit coverage accidental loss of life, limbs, sight, speech, or hearing."
